          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %strong distributivity pullback
            is the data which encodes a particular
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponentiable+morphism"} exponentiation
            along a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/morphism"} morphism
            in a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cofree+object"} cofree object
            with respect to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/base+change"} base change
            functor.
